EMG Gestures Dataset
====================

Description
-----------
This dataset contains EMG recordings during hand gesture tasks. Participants performed
various hand gestures including baseline (rest), extension, flexion, and victory signs.

Equipment
---------
- EMG System: Anthriq Armband
- Sampling Rate: 1000 Hz (estimated)
- Electrode Type: Dry electrodes
- EMG Channels: 8 channels (armband configuration)
- Channel Locations: Cz, O1, T5, P3, Fz, T3, Fp1, F3 (10-20 positions on forearm)

Data Processing
---------------
Raw CSV files are provided without preprocessing.
<!-- For preprocessed data, filters applied: [0.5-450] Hz bandpass, 50 Hz notch filter. -->

Gestures
--------
- baseline: Rest position (gesture ID 0)
- extension: Hand extension (gesture ID 1)
- flexion: Hand flexion
- victory: Victory sign (gesture ID 6)

Recording Protocol
------------------
- Multiple trials per gesture
- Each recording is approximately 20 seconds
- 12 runs total

Recording Location
------------------
Anthriq Lab

Contact
-------
Anthriq 
